OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-key

# SERPER_API_KEY is a WEB-SEARCH credential for the crewai crew below
# (`crew.py:18` constructs `SerperDevTool` from it). It is NOT a news or sentiment
# source.
#
# WS-7 T18 / D17 decides which sources may produce a news or sentiment datum, and
# Serper is not among them: D17:241 permits "NewsAPI, GDELT, CryptoPanic, RSS/Atom"
# plus "PICC's own headed/headless browser". Serper remains live for
# `/api/trading/news`, `amazon.mjs`'s competitor lookup and this search tool, and
# T5 (AC-017) resolved it by making the documentation tell the truth rather than
# by deleting the import. The 5% Copilot Sentiment expert reads the sources below.
#
# None of these is ministry-gated and none is required for the app to start: with
# every one unset the digest reports a NAMED absence and the Sentiment expert
# reports `unavailable` with a reason, keeping its 5% weight. Nothing defaults to
# neutral (spec :1386). Configure them in apps/dashboard/.env — this file is the
# AGENTS app's, and the news sources are read by the dashboard server.
# SERPER_API_KEY=your-serper-key

# ── D17 news & sentiment sources (dashboard server; all optional) ─────────────
#
# PICC_NEWS_FEEDS   comma-separated absolute http(s) RSS/Atom feed URLs. The only
#                   source that needs no credential, and the one that works today.
# PICC_NEWS_GDELT=on          GDELT DOC 2.0, key-less open data.
# NEWSAPI_API_KEY             NewsAPI. Also needs PICC_NEWS_NEWSAPI=on.
# PICC_NEWS_NEWSAPI=on        Opt in to the NewsAPI leg. A key alone is not a
#                             decision to publish news from it.
# CRYPTOPANIC_AUTH_TOKEN      CryptoPanic. Also needs PICC_NEWS_CRYPTOPANIC=on.
# PICC_NEWS_CRYPTOPANIC=on    Opt in to the CryptoPanic leg.
# PICC_NEWS_BROWSER_SOURCES   comma-separated page URLs for PICC's OWN browser, the
#                             sanctioned path for a source that publishes no API.
#                             Disclosed under D22/D25; the mode is recorded on every
#                             datum obtained this way.